// A group cardinality at the start of a line is the group cardinality of the clafer on the
// line (#117): 2..3 is the group cardinality of b, whose children are optional, not the
// cardinality of a, which is mandatory. The same after a nested clafer, and at a dedent.

a
2..3 b
  c
  d
  e
f
  g
  1..2 h
    i
    j
    k
1..* l
  m
  n
